# World step profile, ported from upstream b2Profile in types.h. Physics2D
# measures its own stage granularity: the broad-phase pair pass, the
# collision pass, the solve pass, and the sensor pass, plus the whole step.
# Upstream's finer solver stage timings are internal to the port's fused
# solve pass. All times are wall-clock milliseconds measured with the Objo
# clock. The world owns one reusable record; each step overwrites it.
Class WorldProfile
## Milliseconds spent in the whole step.
Property StepMs As Double
## Milliseconds spent updating broad-phase pairs.
Property PairsMs As Double
## Milliseconds spent in the collision pass.
Property CollideMs As Double
## Milliseconds spent in the solve pass.
Property SolveMs As Double
## Milliseconds spent detecting sensor overlaps.
Property SensorsMs As Double
End Class
